        <mxCell id="2eJa07rHfNJtS575VV4D-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Docker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Docker is a containerization platform that allows us to package an application and all its dependencies into a lightweight, isolated container. This helps us ensure that the application works consistently across development, testing, and production environments&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
