        <mxCell id="2eJa07rHfNJtS575VV4D-32" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="1. Space optimization&lt;div&gt;2. Guest OS Not required(space saving)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. need to insall all depndies during application deployment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Dependencies issue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
