        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2eJa07rHfNJtS575VV4D-34" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;ehz07r&quot; data-start=&quot;90&quot; data-end=&quot;131&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Docker se ye problems solve hoti hain&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchor&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e4ozy9&quot; data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Space Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;158&quot; data-end=&quot;161&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Docker containers lightweight hote hain aur host OS ka kernel share karte hain, isliye VMs ke comparison mein &lt;strong data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;306&quot;&gt;kam disk space aur resources&lt;/strong&gt; consume karte hain.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fngpcw&quot; data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;533&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;Guest OS is Not Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;362&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Har application ke liye separate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;Guest OS&lt;/strong&gt; ki requirement nahi hoti, unlike VMs. Containers host OS ke kernel ko share karte hain, which saves resources and storage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m8re9i&quot; data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;792&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;538&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;Manual Dependency Installation is Not Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;588&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application ki required dependencies, libraries aur runtime ko &lt;strong data-start=&quot;657&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;Docker image mein package&lt;/strong&gt; kar sakte hain. Deployment ke time server par har dependency manually install karne ki zarurat nahi hoti.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7tfv3c&quot; data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;1011&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Dependency &amp;amp; Version Conflicts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Docker application aur uski dependencies ko &lt;strong data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;isolated containers&lt;/strong&gt; mein run karta hai. Isse different applications ke runtime/library versions ke conflicts reduce hote hain.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="420" x="137.5" y="1320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
